  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Integrating Treatment Dental Practices into Your Dental Implant Procedure\n\n\nAugust 14, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nIn the realm of modern dentistry, few advancements have been as transformative as dental implants. For individuals facing tooth loss due to injury, decay, or other dental issues, dental implants offer a revolutionary solution that seamlessly blends function and aesthetics.\n\n\n## Implants and Their Integral Role in Modern Dentistry\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA, have considerably evolved since their inception. Initially made from seashells and carved bones, modern dental implants have provided a reliable, long-term solution to tooth loss. Clinically proven to be the most successful and robust solution with an average success rate of 95%, dental implants have become the standard care for tooth replacement.\n\nToday’s dental implants are crafted from biocompatible materials, such as titanium, which integrates seamlessly with the jawbone. This osseointegration process ensures that the implant becomes a stable foundation for replacement teeth, effectively restoring both functionality and aesthetics. Patients can enjoy the ability to eat and speak confidently as these implants mimic the look and feel of natural teeth.\n\n\n## How Treatment Dental Factors into Dental Implant Procedures\n\n\nDental treatment for dental implants incorporates everything from patient consultations and diagnostics to surgical procedures and follow-up care. This holistic approach not only optimizes the success of the implants but also enhances the overall patient experience, leading to renewed confidence and improved quality of life for those facing tooth loss.\n\nBy adopting a treatment dental approach, practitioners can improve success by focusing on individual patient needs and implementing a personalized dental implant plan. It also emphasizes long-term care, ensuring implants remain prosperous and healthy over time.\n\nA personalized dental implant plan starts with comprehensive diagnostics, including medical history evaluations and advanced imaging techniques, to determine the best course of action. This individualized approach not only addresses the technical aspects of implant placement but also considers the patient’s emotional and psychological factors, such as anxiety about the procedure or concerns about the final appearance of their smile.\n\n\n## Why Choose Our Practice for a Treatment in McLean, VA\n\n\nWe listen to your concerns, understand your needs, and tailor our procedures accordingly to deliver the best results. Thanks to our skilled Dr. Nahlah, our numerous satisfied patients testify to our dedication and commitment.\n\nWhy not experience the exceptional care and professional service at Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA, for yourself? With our treatment dental approach to dental implants, we can promise not just a restored smile but also an improved quality of life.\n\nTranscend traditional dental implant experiences and switch to our holistic, patient-centered service. Set your appointment today, and let us give you the dental care you deserve.\n\nPrevPreviousRevolutionize Your Smile with Dental Implants in McLean, VA\n\nNextNavigating the World of Dental Implant Surgery in McLean, VANext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
